Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1512
Set Height 768
Set FontSize 18
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set LineHeight 1.18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 24
Set Padding 22
Set Margin 18
Set MarginFill "#11121b"
Set BorderRadius 8
Hide
Type "python3 docs/demo/seed.py picker"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Down
Space
Down
Space
Sleep 500ms
Show
Screenshot target/readme-demo/picker-source.png
Sleep 400ms
